      "webhookId": "site-publish",
      "notes": "POST /webhook/site/publish-npj\nAuthorization: Bearer <Matrix access token>\nBody: {filename, mode: 'append'|'overwrite', contentRaw, message, compress?}\nCreates or updates the file in clovenbradshaw-ctrl/npj (main).\n\nAuthorization (Whoami -> Fetch Roles -> Authorize -> Build Content):\n  admin  -> any file, any mode (site/layout.json is admin-only).\n  editor -> articles/<slug>.jsonl ONLY (the EO article logs):\n            create a new log, or append/rewrite an existing one ONLY if\n            they are listed in the log's genesis assignees (checked in\n            Build Content against the fetched file). 403 otherwise.\n  anyone else -> 401.\nArticles are append-only EO event logs: publish writes the INS genesis\nline; every edit POSTs mode:'append' with one REC line."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://hyphae.social/_matrix/client/v3/account/whoami",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "={{ ($json.headers && ($json.headers.authorization || $json.headers.Authorization)) || '' }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "0aa6f1cf-7e09-4f0e-9a01-2b9a6cfb1101",
      "name": "Whoami",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -560,
        128
      ],
      "continueOnFail": true,
      "notes": "Re-verifies the caller's Matrix token with the homeserver. The ONLY trust root: a forged/expired token gets no user_id and the request dies at Authorize. neverError so a 401 from the homeserver flows through as data instead of failing the run."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/clovenbradshaw-ctrl/npj/main/site/layout.json",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "cb",
              "value": "={{ Date.now() }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true,
              "responseFormat": "text",
              "outputPropertyName": "data"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "3f1f3a72-4f4f-4f8a-b0d3-6f1e2a9c2202",
      "name": "Fetch Roles",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -336,
        128
      ],
      "continueOnFail": true,
      "notes": "Pulls the committed permission map (site/layout.json → layout.roles). cb param busts the raw CDN cache so newly delegated roles apply immediately. 404 (nothing committed yet) is fine: Authorize then admits only the founding admin."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Authorize — Matrix identity -> role -> decision.\n// Identity comes ONLY from the homeserver's whoami answer; roles come from the\n// last layout the admin committed (site/layout.json). Bootstrap: before any\n// layout exists, only the founding admin passes.\n//   site/layout.json (layout + roles)        -> admin only\n//   articles/<slug>.jsonl (EO article logs)  -> admin or editor\n//     (editors are further checked against the log's genesis assignees in\n//      Build Content, where the existing file is at hand)\n//   everything else (site files, chain)      -> admin only\nconst ADMIN = '@collective_boundary730383:hyphae.social';\nconst ARTICLE_RE = /^articles\\/[a-z0-9][a-z0-9-]*\\.jsonl$/;\n\nconst hook = $('Publish Webhook').first().json;\nconst body = hook.body && typeof hook.body === 'object' ? hook.body : hook;\nconst filename = body && body.filename ? String(body.filename) : '';\nconst mode = body && body.mode ? String(body.mode) : 'overwrite';\n\nconst who = $('Whoami').first().json || {};\nconst userId = who.user_id || null;\n\nlet roles = {};\ntry {\n  const raw = $('Fetch Roles').first().json || {};\n  const text = typeof raw.data === 'string' ? raw.data : JSON.stringify(raw);\n  const parsed = JSON.parse(text);\n  const lay = parsed && (parsed.layout || parsed);\n  if (lay && lay.roles && typeof lay.roles === 'object') roles = lay.roles;\n} catch (e) { /* no committed layout yet -> founder only */ }\n\nconst role = userId === ADMIN ? 'admin' : (userId ? (roles[userId] || null) : null);\nconst isArticle = ARTICLE_RE.test(filename);\nconst modeOk = mode === 'append' || mode === 'overwrite';\nconst authorized = !!userId && !!filename && modeOk &&\n  (role === 'admin' || (role === 'editor' && isArticle));\n\nreturn [{ json: { authorized, user_id: userId, role, filename, mode, isArticle } }];"
      },
      "id": "8e7b9d54-2c11-4f3e-9f6a-aa8d4b663303",
      "name": "Authorize",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
